      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.03,
          "end": 3.88,
          "en": "Now this notification is there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.88,
          "end": 5.05,
          "en": "and that's great.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.05,
          "end": 7,
          "en": "But it would be good if, eventually,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7,
          "end": 8.92,
          "en": "it would disappear.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 8.92,
          "end": 10.89,
          "en": "And that's something which we can implement.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 10.89,
          "end": 13.6,
          "en": "And I want to make sure that it can be removed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 13.6,
          "end": 15.53,
          "en": "in two different ways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 15.53,
          "end": 19.11,
          "en": "We can click it, and then it should be removed instantly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 19.11,
          "end": 21.31,
          "en": "Alternatively, there should be a timer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 21.31,
          "end": 23.88,
          "en": "which removes it after three seconds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 23.88,
          "end": 27.15,
          "en": "if it's a success or error notification.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 27.15,
          "end": 28.68,
          "en": "Pending notifications",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 28.68,
          "end": 32.21,
          "en": "should not be removed automatically, let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 32.21,
          "end": 34.13,
          "en": "Now to implement this, we can dive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 34.13,
          "end": 36.08,
          "en": "into the notification component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 36.08,
          "end": 40.68,
          "en": "and start with the click case, simply by adding onClick",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 40.68,
          "end": 43.02,
          "en": "and doing something when it is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 43.02,
          "end": 46.06,
          "en": "Now the question is what we wanna do if it's clicked,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 46.06,
          "end": 49.44,
          "en": "and I would say we wanna call hideNotification",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 49.44,
          "end": 50.9,
          "en": "on our context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 50.9,
          "end": 54.65,
          "en": "So I will just use context inside of this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 54.65,
          "end": 57.68,
          "en": "There's nothing that prevents us from doing that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 57.68,
          "end": 60.1,
          "en": "Just because we show this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 60.1,
          "end": 61.49,
          "en": "because of context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 61.49,
          "end": 65,
          "en": "does not mean that we can't use context in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 65,
          "end": 67.24,
          "en": "So I'll use the useContext hook,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 67.24,
          "end": 69.853,
          "en": "which you should import from React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 71.03,
          "end": 74.02,
          "en": "and I'll import the NotificationContext",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 74.02,
          "end": 77.03,
          "en": "from the store folder and there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 77.03,
          "end": 79.13,
          "en": "notification-context file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 79.13,
          "end": 81.563,
          "en": "to establish this connection here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 82.43,
          "end": 85.94,
          "en": "Then here we have the notificationContext object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 85.94,
          "end": 89.74,
          "en": "and now we can use that to hide the notification.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 89.74,
          "end": 93.15100000000001,
          "en": "Because in our context, there is this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 93.15100000000001,
          "end": 96.35,
          "en": "hideNotification function which we call,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 96.35,
          "end": 98.58,
          "en": "which we can call, which eventually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 98.58,
          "end": 101.44,
          "en": "will call this function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 101.44,
          "end": 102.72999999999999,
          "en": "Now thereafter, what we can do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 102.72999999999999,
          "end": 104.83,
          "en": "in the notification component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 104.83,
          "end": 109.83,
          "en": "is we can just bind onClick to notificationCtx.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 110.28999999999999,
          "end": 112.66,
          "en": "So to this notificationContext object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 112.66,
          "end": 114.91,
          "en": "I'm getting from my context here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 114.91,
          "end": 118.693,
          "en": "and then point at the hideNotification function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 119.67,
          "end": 123.07,
          "en": "Don't execute it here, so no parentheses,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 123.07,
          "end": 125.93,
          "en": "but instead let React execute it for you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 125.93,
          "end": 127.35,
          "en": "when that click occurs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 127.35,
          "end": 130.123,
          "en": "That's what we do by pointing at it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 130.96,
          "end": 133.19,
          "en": "And then with that, if we save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 133.19,
          "end": 136.24,
          "en": "if I click the notification, it disappears.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 136.24,
          "end": 138.48,
          "en": "Shows up again, disappears.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 138.48,
          "end": 140.52,
          "en": "So that's working.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 140.52,
          "end": 143.76,
          "en": "Now it should also disappear automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 143.76,
          "end": 147.12,
          "en": "And for this, we can go back into the notificationContext.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 147.12,
          "end": 150.28,
          "en": "And there we might wanna set a timer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 150.28,
          "end": 154.41,
          "en": "whenever the notification starts showing up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 154.41,
          "end": 157.3,
          "en": "And that is a perfect-use case for useEffect,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 157.3,
          "end": 160.07,
          "en": "because that allows us to listen to changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 160.07,
          "end": 162.82999999999998,
          "en": "to the notification object, and then act",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 162.82999999999998,
          "end": 164.93,
          "en": "when it does change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 164.93,
          "end": 167.007,
          "en": "So here I'll then import useEffect,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 168.84,
          "end": 172.26,
          "en": "and add a new useEffect call here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 172.26,
          "end": 175.823,
          "en": "And at the useEffect function enter the dependency array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 176.68,
          "end": 179.302,
          "en": "Now in the useEffect function, I wanna check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 179.302,
          "end": 182.385,
          "en": "if activeNotification is set,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 182.385,
          "end": 184.083,
          "en": "and, important,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 184.083,
          "end": 186.416,
          "en": "if activeNotification status",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 187.4,
          "end": 189.4,
          "en": "is equal to success",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 190.48,
          "end": 195.443,
          "en": "or if activeNotification status is equal to error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 197.88,
          "end": 200.06,
          "en": "And I'll wrap that in parentheses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 200.06,
          "end": 202.87,
          "en": "so that the first condition must always be met",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 202.87,
          "end": 206.21,
          "en": "and then either of the two other conditions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 206.21,
          "end": 208.64,
          "en": "So if we have an activeNotification,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 208.64,
          "end": 210.84,
          "en": "then we also perform those checks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 210.84,
          "end": 212.47899999999998,
          "en": "to make it into this IF block",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 212.47899999999998,
          "end": 216.37,
          "en": "if we have an activeNotification with a status",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 216.37,
          "end": 218.64,
          "en": "of success and error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 218.64,
          "end": 220.29,
          "en": "If we have no activeNotification,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 221.39,
          "end": 223.64,
          "en": "or if the status is pending,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 223.64,
          "end": 225.95,
          "en": "we don't do anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 225.95,
          "end": 229.14,
          "en": "Now if we do have this kind of notification though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 229.14,
          "end": 232.21,
          "en": "then I wanna set a timer that will eventually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 232.21,
          "end": 234.03300000000002,
          "en": "remove the notification though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 234.9,
          "end": 239.9,
          "en": "So then here I'll set a timer with setTimeout,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 241.34,
          "end": 244.17,
          "en": "which will eventually do something.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 244.17,
          "end": 247.383,
          "en": "And it should do that after three seconds roughly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 248.41,
          "end": 251.37,
          "en": "And what it should do, is that it should call",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 251.37,
          "end": 254.88,
          "en": "setActiveNotification and set this to null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 254.88,
          "end": 256.85,
          "en": "Or, to be precise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 256.85,
          "end": 260.1,
          "en": "it should call hideNotificationHandler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 260.1,
          "end": 262.29,
          "en": "We could, of course, also call that function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 262.29,
          "end": 265.313,
          "en": "But I'll just set the activeNotification to null here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 267.01,
          "end": 271.59,
          "en": "Now I'll return here, I'll return that cleanup function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 271.59,
          "end": 276.46,
          "en": "which useEffect accepts, to clear that timer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 276.46,
          "end": 278.9,
          "en": "so that timer, which has stored this constant,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 278.9,
          "end": 283.05,
          "en": "if useEffect reruns before the timer went off,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 283.05,
          "end": 285.75,
          "en": "so that we don't have multiple ongoing timers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 285.75,
          "end": 287.56,
          "en": "at the same time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 287.56,
          "end": 290.85,
          "en": "So here I'm utilizing this cleanup function of useEffect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 290.85,
          "end": 293.90999999999997,
          "en": "All that code here is still in this IF block, though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 293.90999999999997,
          "end": 296.883,
          "en": "If we're not making it in there, useEffect does nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 298.26,
          "end": 301.88,
          "en": "Now since we are relying on the activeNotification here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 301.88,
          "end": 304.13,
          "en": "and since we want to rerun this effect,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 304.13,
          "end": 306.57,
          "en": "whenever the activeNotification changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 306.57,
          "end": 310.263,
          "en": "I'll add activeNotification as a dependency here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 311.87,
          "end": 313.5,
          "en": "And with this implemented,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 313.5,
          "end": 315.76,
          "en": "it should disappear automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 315.76,
          "end": 320.76,
          "en": "If I do register, we see pending, and then success,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 321.7,
          "end": 325.49,
          "en": "and after three seconds it disappears automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 325.49,
          "end": 328.08,
          "en": "We also don't have any errors here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 328.08,
          "end": 331.38,
          "en": "except for that 500 error from earlier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 331.38,
          "end": 332.96,
          "en": "So that is working.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 332.96,
          "end": 336.08,
          "en": "And that is how we use this notification component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 336.08,
          "end": 340.19,
          "en": "with React context for app-wide state management",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 340.19,
          "end": 342.45,
          "en": "and for giving the user some feedback",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 342.45,
          "end": 344.313,
          "en": "about the sign-up process.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 345.27,
          "end": 347.47,
          "en": "Now I got a challenge for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 347.47,
          "end": 349.81,
          "en": "We also have this comments area,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 349.81,
          "end": 352.77,
          "en": "where the user should get some feedback.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 352.77,
          "end": 355.1,
          "en": "And here, I want you to work on that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 355.1,
          "end": 358.57,
          "en": "When a new comment is added, so when we click submit here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 358.57,
          "end": 360.34,
          "en": "I want you to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
